sequenceDiagram
    participant C as React or Flutter
    participant I as Identity API
    participant DB as Identity DB
    C->>I: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (Refresh)
    I->>DB: Atomic hash lookup, family/active/expiry check and rotation
    alt Valid refresh
        DB-->>I: New session persisted, old token revoked
        I-->>C: 200 access JWT and rotated refresh storage
    else Reused/expired/disabled token
        I->>DB: Revoke family on reuse
        I-->>C: 401
    end
    C->>I: POST /api/v1/auth/logout (Logout), own session
    I->>DB: Revoke own refresh family
    I-->>C: 204
    Note over C,I: Existing access JWT expires within 15 minutes, no Redis blacklist
